{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这不是很好吗。你跟瓜生君和好了。”", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6982", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，呃……是啦……”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7516", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那是什么奇怪的反应？”", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6983", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………因为不是和好这种程度的。”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7517", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以说……？”", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6984", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的、真的、真的～～～太厉害了！”", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7518", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉就算到了今天，那个余韵还残留在我体内……”", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7519", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是那个，身体麻麻的……特别是腹部……哈啊……♪”", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7520", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……做、做得那么好吃吗？”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6985", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？什么？”", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7521", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还问什么……巧克力啊。你不是在说跟瓜生君一起吃巧克力的事吗？”", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6986", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………唉。”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7522", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在那个高高在上的眼神又是怎样？”", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6987", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀～就算是小爱理也不懂呢～”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7523", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……虽然的确不懂，但是莫名让人火大。”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6988", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早知道就不问你了。你一个人骄傲去吧，再见。”", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6989", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊～等一下等一下抱歉啦！我是太开心了忍不住，我跟你道歉不要走啦爱理！”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7524", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“与其道歉最初就不要说那种话。唉……所以呢？你还没讲够吧？”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6990", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不愧是爱理，真聪明！谢谢你，那个啊，该怎么说呢……”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7525", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾其实是超级肉食系。”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7526", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么？”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6991", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果要形容，就是一回想起昨天的事情……唔……唔……”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7527", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂，没、没事吧？”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "ar6992", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没事，只是太幸福了，我已经……回不去……要去到天涯海角……”", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7528", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟新吾一起……哈啊……”", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7529", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真、真的没事吗？从刚才你的身体就在一抖一抖的喔！”", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "_ar6656", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是不是身体出什么问题了？”", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "_ar6657", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“下次会被怎么样呢，明明平常那么温柔，那么热情让我神魂颠倒，啊啊，新吾新吾新吾……”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7530", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……有问题的是……脑袋？”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 505, "voice": "_ar6658", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔，新吾，你也收到巧克力了吗？”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1800", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，有几个义理的。”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为今年的情人节是星期日嘛～”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1801", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室里，女生们正在吃剩下来没送出去的巧克力（？）。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "女孩子很喜欢像那样朋友之间交换呢。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以，本命巧克力怎么样了？”", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1802", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，托福。”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊，顺利就好。”", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1803", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那隼太呢……问你这个好像太不上道了。”", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是说啊，这种事又不能到处乱讲～”", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1804", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太好狡猾，你自己明明一直问我。”", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀哎呀，是因为你一脸春风得意我才问的喔。”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1805", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被隼太这么一说，我忍不住摸摸自己的脸。", "text_idx": 521, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天的事，甚至让我表现在脸上了吗……", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我应该是很擅长控制表情的才对。", "text_idx": 492, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过啊──”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1806", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，找到了找到了，男生在聊什么？我很闲让我也加入吧！”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5072", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聊到一半，走进教室的纱凪站到我身旁。", "text_idx": 518, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后笑着撞了一下我的肩膀。", "text_idx": 502, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔啊，新吾那是什么！？”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5073", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？啊，是班上同学送我的义理巧克力。”", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么！？为什么你收下除了我以外的人送的巧克力！”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5074", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为是义理的啊。”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不用狡辩，这个要没收！”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5075", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘻嘻，大丰收大丰收♪爱理，我弄到了巧克力一起吃吧～？”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5076", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "抢走了她想要的东西后就立刻走到濑名同学那里了。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1807", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不必笑我吧。”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，我只是觉得好自然啊。”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1808", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“自然？”", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小乾在你的身边这件事。”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1809", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是吗？”", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“恋人就是这么自然相处的身份呢。”", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1810", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太也是那样喔。”", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯？你在说什么？”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1811", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之前在我跟纱凪走在路上，不是遇到了隼太你们吗？”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个时候我跟纱凪就聊到了。”", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那时的隼太你们跟我们不同，看起来非常自然。”", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们还说希望有一天也能变成像隼太你们那样……某种意义上来说，是憧憬吧。”", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1812", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿～我们看起来是那样啊。”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1813", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然自己不会注意到？”", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想是吧。所谓的男人跟女人……”", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1814", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果在隼太看来我们也很自然，那我真的很高兴。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过我觉得真的很相配喔。你跟小乾。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1815", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可是最近纱凪变得太可爱了让我有点困扰。”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔哈哈，你的表情看起来根本不是那样说的。”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 525, "voice": "_ht1816_01", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来我还在春风得意。", "text_idx": 509, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，再半个月美羽学姐就要毕业了……”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5077", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽美羽不留级吗？”", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0472", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么可能留。学姐跟我不同，她很聪明的。”", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5078", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那边的笨蛋，留级吧你。”", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0473", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，你从哪学到留级这个词的？”", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5079", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这点小事当然知道。”", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0474", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……真无趣。感觉好无趣啊～”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5080", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央君还是一样知识丰富，纱凪表情很复杂。", "text_idx": 508, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最近理央君常常来社团教室玩。", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，学姐毕业后我们社团会变成怎样呢……”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5081", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“消灭。”", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0475", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要说那种不吉利的话！只要有我在就绝对不会让那种事发生！”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5082", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾怎么想？”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0476", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么想？”", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个消灭的胸部。”", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0477", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我的胸部才没有消灭啦！新吾也是，啊什么啊！”", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5083", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "拼命强调，还自己挤胸部的纱凪好可爱。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我的只要挤一挤还是很大的喔。”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5084", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你平常总是让她做那种徒劳无功的事吗？”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0478", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我没有让她那么做。”", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种话题还是冷处理比较好。", "text_idx": 524, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我的确没有让她那么做，但是一个不小心可能会说出不应该说的话。", "text_idx": 520, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……毕竟勾起了脑海中的各种记忆。", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就是这样。", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“学姐毕业后安洁是第一，之后是爱理，对手是小樱乃吧……”", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5085", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……纱凪在说什么？”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪碎碎念着，依然继续在挤自己的胸部。", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽美羽不在的话，无聊。”", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0479", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说来，还没有决定下一任社长是谁呢。”", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我来当社长。”", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0480", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～♪”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "_pn0637", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在那之前理央是要上小学吧。你能交到朋友吗～？”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5086", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我不需要朋友，我有熊喵。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0481", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜！？”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "_pn0638", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唉，理央真是出门一条虫。”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5087", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要在学校交朋友才行喔！”", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5088", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0482", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“吵死了，我要回去了。”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0483", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，喂！每次都这样闹脾气！”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5089", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央君把怀里的熊喵放下，然后跑出社团教室了。", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的没问题吗，那孩子……”", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5090", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没事的。理央君是个很聪明的孩子。”", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果是这样就好了……”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5091", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 503, "voice": "_pn0639", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪关上社团教室的门，叹了口气。", "text_idx": 512, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我从背后抱住她。", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾的这种地方好狡猾。”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5092", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想有人抱我的时候你就会抱我。”", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5093", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么你会知道这种事呢？”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5094", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我歪了歪头。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这不是看场面气氛知道的。", "text_idx": 523, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而是身体自己就动了，刚才也是。", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "几乎不是经过思考的行为。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，对了对了，刚才胸部的话题……”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5095", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪改变了话题，转身面对我。", "text_idx": 513, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我的胸部的确很小，是B罩杯。这是无法否认的事实。”", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "_sn5096", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是……仔细想想，这样才好吧。刚好适合新吾的手掌。”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7531", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪有点害羞地笑笑，从正面抱住我。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "胸部就贴在我的身上，我反射性地下腹部紧绷。", "text_idx": 519, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……新吾好像在紧张……”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7532", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“该不会是我胸部的触感就让你有那种想法了吧……？”", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 511, "voice": "sn7533", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……纱凪也很狡猾，各种意义上。”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 498, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我早早就举白旗投降。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她实在太有魅力了。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "经过昨天后威力又更升级。", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今后更是无法想像。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0484", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，钥匙……”", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0485", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "母ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……噜……”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "熊喵？", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "_mp0006", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0486", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "母ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜……”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵？", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "_mp0007", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你……”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0487", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是熊喵吗？”", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0488", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "母ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵？", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "_mp0008", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“来这里。”", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0489", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要怕，过来。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0490", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "母ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜！？噜！”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵？", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "_mp0009", "char_id": "母ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route08_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不要逃！等一下！”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 506, "voice": "_ri0491", "char_id": "理央"}]}
